[SPEAKER_09]: It did its charge.

146
00:10:49,546 --> 00:10:52,148
[SPEAKER_09]: There was actually one about fire stations as well.

147
00:10:52,728 --> 00:10:56,111
[SPEAKER_09]: The mayor announced today a solid waste task force.

148
00:10:56,631 --> 00:10:57,872
[SPEAKER_09]: So that's actually my announcement.

149
00:10:58,910 --> 00:11:13,308
