183
00:14:11,951 --> 00:14:15,193
[SPEAKER_09]: So somebody must've decided that it was a mistake and didn't ask me.

184
00:14:17,034 --> 00:14:19,156
[SPEAKER_09]: I'll tell Lisa that she moved it again.

185
00:14:19,176 --> 00:14:25,480
[SPEAKER_09]: Honestly, I don't know what the value is to the public of having the distinction on the website.

186
00:14:29,747 --> 00:14:33,531
