[SPEAKER_09]: cross between our two offices.

230
00:17:59,955 --> 00:18:04,517
[SPEAKER_09]: And so I have not, I've re-advertised for an energy festival in turn.

231
00:18:06,458 --> 00:18:10,421
[SPEAKER_09]: In the meantime, Teresa has started some of the early things for that work.

232
00:18:11,381 --> 00:18:14,663
[SPEAKER_09]: And I'm gonna give an offer to another graduate student

233
00:18:15,053 --> 00:18:19,315
[SPEAKER_09]: who we would actually just pay out of city budget funds to do work with our office.

234
00:18:20,236 --> 00:18:27,940
