[SPEAKER_09]: Sorry, Benji seconded it.

1007
01:34:38,266 --> 01:34:38,626
[SPEAKER_01]: Okay.

1008
01:34:38,686 --> 01:34:39,347
[SPEAKER_01]: Okay.

1009
01:34:39,567 --> 01:34:41,369
