[SPEAKER_01]: Okay, unanimously approved.

1034
01:35:20,888 --> 01:35:28,750
[SPEAKER_04]: Thank you, Barry, for- I still think we should, in the education subcommittee, if we are gonna put emphasis on something, we should put emphasis on this.

1035
01:35:29,071 --> 01:35:41,235
[SPEAKER_04]: And by this, I mean exactly what Loreta said, related to not raking and actually the sort of, I don't know how to call it, but the pretty sort of yard landscaping

1036
01:35:42,654 --> 01:35:55,438
[SPEAKER_04]: try to change a little bit, again, through showing why that's not the best thing that you can do to try to convince people to go in some other direction.

1037
