[SPEAKER_01]: Go ahead.

1042
01:36:07,703 --> 01:36:24,569
[SPEAKER_09]: that if the committee was so inclined, they could also entertain a motion to ask the mayor to ban gas powered leaf blowers on city property, because that would basically mean don't hire.

1043
01:36:25,620 --> 01:36:29,301
[SPEAKER_09]: And that is completely in her authority when she puts that.

1044
